/**
 * The injury impact analysis, as pure functions.
 *
 * Every number the dashboard prints is computed here, from the packed
 * datasets, the way the standalone app's Dashboard.tsx computed it inside its
 * React memos (statchasersff-bit/RESEARCH-Injury-Impact-Analysis at c6a49ce).
 * The arithmetic is the app's verbatim, rounding steps included: the test
 * fixture is generated by running those memo bodies, cut out of the component,
 * over the same data, and every figure here has to match it.
 *
 * Shared by the server, which renders the default view, and by the browser
 * bundle, which recomputes a view when a filter moves. Nothing here touches
 * the DOM or the file system.
 */

